Z||000000||My7Fieros||08-10-2001||05:35 PM||||Ok Ive picked up Delta Force (1) for my pc a few weeks ago at Wally world (it was only 10 bucks). I play it constantly (when Im not on here of course). Ive been doing really well to. But the other day I came across a website that listed some "cheat" codes for it. I know, this can take away from the fun or challenge....but from time to time, just for a goof, its fun....in case you didnt know, (and of course if you own Delta Force), here are the (some) cheat codes...<BR>When you start playing the game, push the "~" key (next to the 1)..its the command key or whatever in the game. <BR>1.) iwillsurvive...just like that, no spaces, is the god mode...cant die.<BR>2.) takeittothelimit...unlimited ammo (really fun with the LAW weapon)<BR>3.) closetoyou...invisible...yeah!<BR>Use any, or for some real cheatin' fun, use all three!<BR>Of course I dont play the game like this constantly, but from time to time it <I>is</I> fun! I dont know of any for DF2. Try it out, enjoy!<BR>||||reg||1
